    "Gelbe Punkte sind vermutete Ampelkreuzungen der gewählten Radroute — aus OpenStreetMap und aus dem, was deine eigenen Fahrten gelernt haben.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yellow dots are presumed signalised junctions on the chosen bike route — from OpenStreetMap and from what your own rides have learned."
          }
        }
      }
    },
