    "Weiterfahren": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep riding"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welche Linien das Rad mitnehmen, weißt du besser als jeder Fahrplan. Die Liste füllt sich mit den Linien, die in gefundenen Verbindungen vorkommen; was die Auskunft selbst zusichert, steht schon auf „ja“. Solange eine Linie offen ist, wird die Fahrt trotzdem vorgeschlagen — mit dem Hinweis, dass die Mitnahme ungeklärt ist.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You know better than any timetable which lines take bikes. The list fills with the lines that appear in the connections found; whatever the service itself guarantees is already set to “yes”. While a line is open the trip is still suggested — with the note that bike carriage is unclear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Westen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "west"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wetterdaten: unerwartete Antwort": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weather data: unexpected response"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wie das Telefon": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Match the phone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wie?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wird einmal abgefragt und in eine Adresse übersetzt. Die App folgt dir nicht.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asked once and turned into an address. The app does not follow you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Womit die App plant, wenn sie die Wahl hat. Ab dem gewählten Regen wird nicht mehr die ganze Strecke geradelt, sondern das Rad in die Bahn gestellt — „starker Regen“ heißt also praktisch immer fahren.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What the app plans with when it has a choice. From the selected rain level on, the bike goes on the train instead of riding the whole way — “heavy rain” therefore means riding almost always."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worauf gefahren": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Surface ridden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zeit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zeit vom Planen bis zum Losgehen. Gilt für jedes Verkehrsmittel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time between planning and walking out. Applies to every mode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zeitpunkt hinzufügen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
